# Send these with the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) - "Send Request" appears above each one.

@host = http://localhost:5280

### Health: is everything actually reachable?
GET {{host}}/health

### Upload a bill
POST {{host}}/api/bills
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----bound

------bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="electric-2025-07.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/electric-2025-07.pdf
------bound--

### List every bill
GET {{host}}/api/bills

### List only electricity bills from 2025
GET {{host}}/api/bills?utility=electricity&from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31

### Ask a question (numeric - answered from SQL totals)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How much did I pay for electricity in July?"
}

### Ask a question (retrieval - answered from the rate table)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the tier 3 electricity rate?"
}

### Ask, scoped to one utility
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Is my usage going up?",
  "utility": "Water"
}

### Streamed answer (server-sent events)
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How much did I spend on utilities altogether in 2025?"
}

### Delete a bill (paste an id from the list above)
DELETE {{host}}/api/bills/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
